<HelpLayout title="Get Support" active="get-support" description="Reach the Folio AI team for help, questions, or feedback.">
  <p>
    Can't find what you need in the guides? We're here to help. Before reaching out, the
    <a href="/help/troubleshooting/">Troubleshooting</a> guide covers the most common issues and is
    often the fastest fix.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact our team</h2>
  <p>
    The best way to reach us is through our support page — fill in the form and we'll get back to
    you shortly.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/support/">Go to the support page</a> to send us a message.</li>
    <li>Prefer email? Write to us at <a href="mailto:contact@get-folio.ai">contact@get-folio.ai</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <p>To help us resolve things quickly, please tell us:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Whether you're using Folio in <strong>PowerPoint</strong> or <strong>Google Slides</strong>, and on Windows, Mac, or the web.</li>
    <li>The email address on your Folio account.</li>
    <li>A short description of what you were trying to do and what happened.</li>
    <li>A screenshot of any error message, if you have one.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Other resources</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/help/">Get started</a> — install Folio and create your first deck.</li>
    <li><a href="/help/plans-and-billing/">Plans and Billing</a> — credits, plans, and subscription questions.</li>
    <li><a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a> — compare plans and features.</li>
  </ul>
</HelpLayout>
